      ],
      "data": {
        "text": "A ring of soft shapes melts and turns while a kaleidoscope folds them over.\nThe Octoscillator is a set of slow chaotic voltages, and it moves the shape's sides, melt and size, the kaleidoscope's angle and zoom, and the colours.\nNothing repeats, so leave it running.\nTry the SPEED knob on the Octoscillator, and its LEVEL knob for bigger moves.\nTry FOLDS on the Rotator and BANDS on the Colorizer."
      }
    }
